  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:9aa04197-2783-4093-a7bb-911058decbde-31\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-60\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2b2088b4-6795-4b4d-926f-9f91e79cce4a\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"381\">De Samsung HW-T420 is een praktische soundbar die het geluid van je televisie duidelijk verbetert ten opzichte van standaard tv-speakers. Ideaal voor films, series en dagelijks gebruik. Ondanks dat de subwoofer en afstandsbediening ontbreken, levert deze soundbar nog steeds helder en krachtig geluid via de ingebouwde speakers.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"567\">Omdat de titel eindigt op <strong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"429\">“Incl. Garantie”</strong> betreft dit een <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"474\">gebruikte maar degelijke</strong> soundbar. Zichtbare gebruikssporen zijn mogelijk, maar het apparaat is volledig functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"600\">Korte productbeschrijving</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"722\">Een degelijke Samsung soundbar voor beter tv-geluid, geschikt voor wie een eenvoudige en betrouwbare audio-upgrade zoekt.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"735\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"818\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"763\">Gebruikt, maar degelijk</strong> – Zichtbare gebruikssporen mogelijk, 100% functioneel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"835\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"883\">\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"883\">🔊 Aanzienlijk beter geluid dan tv-speakers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"918\">\r\n<p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"918\">📺 Ideaal voor films en series</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"951\">\r\n<p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"951\">🎵 Helder en krachtig geluid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"981\">\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"981\">⚙️ Eenvoudige installatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1012\">🖤 Strak en compact design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1034\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1053\">Type: Soundbar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1080\">Model: Samsung HW-T420</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1130\">Audio: 2.1 kanaal (zonder subwoofer geleverd)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1169\">Connectiviteit: Bluetooth, Optical</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1204\">Bediening: Knoppen op soundbar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1221\">Kleur: Zwart</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1256\">Staat: Gebruikt, maar degelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1276\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1350\">Samsung HW-T420 Soundbar<br data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1306\"><em data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1348\">(Geen subwoofer, geen afstandsbediening)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1376\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1413\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1413\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
